"""Guide content: head-to-head comparisons. Data only; rendering lives in engine.py.

Comparison pages carry a standing rule: wherever one of the compared options is
something Yusuf built or sells, the conflict of interest is stated in the page
itself, in the first screen, not buried in a footer. No affiliate links appear on
any of these pages, and no pricing figure is asserted as permanent.
"""

NAV_DEV = [("/", "Work"), ("/guides.html", "Guides"), ("/stack.html", "Stack"), ("/apps.html", "Apps")]

