  ("p", "These are not mutually exclusive and nothing about the licensing forces a choice. A realistic setup for a small team is Trivy on the image in CI, DIRA on the repository and the live domain before a release or a customer call, and Snyk if and when someone is paying for the seat. The tools cost nothing to stack, and each one's blind spot is roughly the other's strength."),
  ("h2", "Wiring whichever you pick into CI"),
