  ("formula", "# fast inner-loop pass, seconds, no network\ndira scan . --only secrets,config\n\n# PR gate: only the files this branch touched\ndira scan . --diff origin/main --fail-on high\n\n# release gate: full run + the live domain, shareable HTML\ndira scan . -t yourapp.com -f html -o report.html\n\n# findings into the GitHub Security tab\ndira scan . -f sarif -o dira.sarif"),
  ("p", "Whatever you choose, set the failure threshold deliberately. A gate that fails on every low-severity informational finding gets disabled within a week, and a disabled gate scans nothing. Start at high, tighten later. If you want the surrounding process rather than just the tool, the <a href=\"/guides/student-founder-security-checklist.html\">student founder's security checklist</a> is the 18-item version of what these scanners automate, including the parts no scanner can check."),
